WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.177
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:05.803
Tiny Coders, video 6.

3
00:00:05.853 --> 00:00:08.680
Bugs: find the mistake.

4
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.864
A bug is a mistake in the instructions.

5
00:00:12.914 --> 00:00:15.850
Finding it is a normal part of coding.

6
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.347
Look at this sandwich plan.

7
00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:24.090
Eat first, then put the filling on, then open the packet.

8
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:28.250
Eating happens before making it — that is the bug.

9
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.251
To debug, read every step.

10
00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:36.377
Ask what happens too early or too late.

11
00:00:36.427 --> 00:00:38.810
Fix it, then try again.

12
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.551
Let us recap.

13
00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.954
Bugs are mistakes in instructions.

14
00:00:45.004 --> 00:00:48.357
Read steps carefully to find them.

15
00:00:48.407 --> 00:00:51.760
Next: Guide a character on a grid.
